          "why": "Add base 3, keep base 2 on screen",
          "start_s": 18.89,
          "end_s": 24.46
        },
        {
          "phrase": "So each base drags along its own constant, sort of like a tax.",
          "template": "equation",
          "props": {
            "tex": "\\begin{aligned}\\frac{d}{dx}\\,2^x &= \\underbrace{0.693}_{\\text{tax}}\\cdot 2^x\\\\ \\frac{d}{dx}\\,3^x &= \\underbrace{1.099}_{\\text{tax}}\\cdot 3^x\\end{aligned}"
